{"title":"Death God","synopsis":"Jongli Chu seorang pejuang Sekte Death Heavenly yang membunuh Hwang Jung untuk membalaskan dendam kakaknya Untuk menghindari pengejaran Sekte Death Heavenly dia meminta bantuan kepada seorang pembunuh dari agensi Death Soul Crimson Assassin dan terhanyut ke dalam kekacauan besar yang dikenal sebagai Pemusnahan Untuk melarikan diri dari bayangbayang Pemusnahan dia tidak punya pilihan selain menjadi Death God yang legendaris Bisakah Jong Lichu menjadi Death God dan menemukan kebebasan dalam aturan menyesakkan yang diciptakan oleh sekte ortodoks","alternative_title":"사신","author":"Lim Jae Won, Seolbong","artist":"Lim Jae Won","genres":["Action","Drama","Historical","Martial Arts","Seinen"],"chapters":[{"id":"ba648ccc-0e7c-40df-b971-84fd88cf4a03","number":"137","title":"Chapter 137","date":"2026-06-04","images":[]},{"id":"1b1fd316-e07a-41b4-8bcd-43262430e6b6","number":"136","title":"Chapter 136","date":"2026-06-04","images":[]},{"id":"4850fc6b-a22d-4124-9378-a22f2e6d1a24","number":"135","title":"Chapter 135","date":"2026-06-04","images":[]},{"id":"6373c64b-0781-47f4-9b3d-d5f58b24e285","number":"134","title":"Chapter 134","date":"2026-06-04","images":[]},{"id":"087af839-7283-4f9c-9c3d-41b1b7c902c3","number":"133","title":"Chapter 133","date":"2026-06-04","images":[]},{"id":"b3be2b3b-a331-48fe-a02b-6f99ff1ec88a","number":"132","title":"Chapter 132","date":"2026-06-04","images":[]},{"id":"3d3a2d35-abeb-4506-bc24-320b99d0767a","number":"130","title":"Chapter 130","date":"2026-05-01","images":[]},{"id":"230daba8-017e-4aa1-ac44-56688d850017","number":"129","title":"Chapter 129","date":"2026-05-01","images":[]},{"id":"7bcf2a28-1ce6-4d7d-8b62-1aa5547cf2b2","number":"128","title":"Chapter 128","date":"2026-05-01","images":[]},{"id":"2f0c6e6c-0731-4abf-8f30-293dc04a876d","number":"127","title":"Chapter 127","date":"2026-05-01","images":[]},{"id":"bc07a17a-6ba1-4c60-86f5-8c5d6cb344d7","number":"126","title":"Chapter 126","date":"2026-01-26","images